    "为 Pink House 换一枚更贴近心情的图标。经典、礼服、珍珠与月光风格都可以收藏，桌面也能保持你喜欢的样子。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a Pink House icon that fits your mood. Classic, gown, pearl, and moonlight styles can all be collected so your Home Screen stays your way."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为 Pink House 换一枚更贴近心情的图标。经典、礼服、珍珠与月光风格都可以收藏，桌面也能保持你喜欢的样子。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為 Pink House 換一枚更貼近心情的圖標。經典、禮服、珍珠與月光風格都可以收藏，桌面也能保持你喜歡的樣子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为了让这套主题更完整，已帮你切回纯色背景；停用主题后可再使用图片背景。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To keep this theme consistent, the background was switched back to a solid color. You can use image backgrounds again after disabling the theme."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了让这套主题更完整，已帮你切回纯色背景；停用主题后可再使用图片背景。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為了讓這套主題更完整，已幫你切回純色背景；停用主題後可再使用圖片背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为兼容 iOS 17.x 热修包，Object Capture 已暂时降级，后续 iOS 18+ 版本可重新启用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Object Capture has been temporarily downgraded for the iOS 17.x hotfix and can be re-enabled for iOS 18+ later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为兼容 iOS 17.x 热修包，Object Capture 已暂时降级，后续 iOS 18+ 版本可重新启用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為兼容 iOS 17.x 熱修包，Object Capture 已暫時降級，後續 iOS 18+ 版本可重新啓用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
