    "兑换会员前，请先阅读并勾选《会员协议》和《使用协议》。确认后将立即扣除对应喵币并生效。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Before redeeming VIP, please read and check the VIP Agreement and User Agreement. After confirmation, the required Meow Coins will be deducted and VIP will take effect immediately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兑换会员前，请先阅读并勾选《会员协议》和《使用协议》。确认后将立即扣除对应喵币并生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兌換會員前，請先閱讀並勾選《會員協議》和《使用協議》。確認後將立即扣除對應喵幣並生效。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIP を引き換える前に、VIP 規約と利用規約を読んでチェックしてください。確認後、必要なニャーコインがすぐに差し引かれ、VIP が有効になります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIP를 교환하기 전에 VIP 약관과 사용 약관을 읽고 체크해 주세요. 확인 후 필요한 야옹 코인이 즉시 차감되고 VIP가 적용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avant d'echanger le VIP, lisez et cochez l'accord VIP et les conditions d'utilisation. Apres confirmation, les pieces Miaou requises seront deduites et le VIP prendra effet immediatement."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lies und markiere vor dem Einloesen die VIP-Vereinbarung und Nutzungsvereinbarung. Nach der Bestaetigung werden die erforderlichen Miau-Muenzen sofort abgezogen und VIP wird aktiv."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Antes de canjear VIP, lee y marca el Acuerdo VIP y el Acuerdo de uso. Tras confirmar, se descontaran las monedas Miau requeridas y VIP se activara de inmediato."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Antes de resgatar o VIP, leia e marque o Contrato VIP e o Contrato de Uso. Apos confirmar, as Moedas Miau necessarias serao descontadas e o VIP entrara em vigor imediatamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
