    "删除账号将清除您的登录信息和个性化设置。\n\n您的衣橱数据将保留在设备本地，但 iCloud 同步功能将停止。\n\n此操作无法撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete Account Clear Info Settings.\n\nCloset Data Keep, iCloud Sync Feature Stop.\n\nAction Unable to Undo."
