    "想买%@，还差一点骨头币。先把鱼币换成骨头币，再回来继续挑吧。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für %@ fehlen noch ein paar Knochenmünzen. Tausche zuerst Fischmünzen in Knochenmünzen und such dann weiter."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You need a few more Bone Coins to buy %@. Exchange Fish Coins for Bone Coins first, then come back to keep choosing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para comprar %@, faltan algunas Monedas Hueso. Cambia Monedas Pez por Monedas Hueso y vuelve a elegir."
